# ============================================================
# 五大工资理财配置公式计算器 — .gitignore
# ============================================================

# ---- 本地工作区 / AI 助手数据（含本机绝对路径与会话记忆，禁止入库）----
.workbuddy-ai/
.windsurf/
.cursor/
.claude/
.aider*
*.local.md

# ---- 环境变量与密钥（真实配置绝不入库）----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets.*
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ---- 依赖与构建产物 ----
node_modules/
vendor/
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---- 系统与编辑器 ----
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- IDE ----
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.code-workspace

# ---- 临时与备份 ----
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
